<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, position: 'relative', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 8, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 34, left: 40, width: 1200 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>模块一：一句话，把文档改对</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 6 }}>入口是自然语言，执行是确定性代码 —— 同一句话，今天和明天跑出来必须一样</Text>
    </Box>

    {/* 左：对话流 */}
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 122, left: 40, width: 690 }}>
        <Box style={{ background: '#1E4FA8', padding: '14px 20px', borderRadius: 10 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#BFD3EE' }}>用户说</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 4 }}>
                "把设备采购合同的标题居中，并且加粗"
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ alignItems: 'center', height: 26, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <svg width={18} height={26} viewBox='0 0 18 26'><line x1='9' y1='0' x2='9' y2='17' stroke='#8B97A8' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M3 16 L9 25 L15 16 Z' fill='#8B97A8' /></svg>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: '14px 20px' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>系统解析（约 1 秒）</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>意图 JSON</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, marginTop: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ background: '#E8EFF8', padding: '8px 12px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#0E3F8C' }}>文档：设备采购合同</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ background: '#E8EFF8', padding: '8px 12px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#0E3F8C' }}>对象：标题</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ background: '#E8EFF8', padding: '8px 12px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#0E3F8C' }}>动作：居中 + 加粗</Text></Box>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 10 }}>
                一句话拆成两个操作，按顺序执行；任一步失败则整体回滚，不留半成品。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ alignItems: 'center', height: 26, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <svg width={18} height={26} viewBox='0 0 18 26'><line x1='9' y1='0' x2='9' y2='17' stroke='#8B97A8' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M3 16 L9 25 L15 16 Z' fill='#8B97A8' /></svg>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderLeft: '4px solid #3D7BD9', padding: '14px 20px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>执行结果</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 4 }}>
                共 1 处改动 → 生成「设备采购合同_格式结果.docx」
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 6 }}>
                原件保持逐字节不变，产物永远是新文件；多轮对话里说"它"，自动对上上一份文档。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* 右：能力与实测 */}
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 122, left: 760, width: 480 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', letterSpacing: 1 }}>能做什么</Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 10, gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #E5E7EB', padding: '10px 12px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>改 / 删 / 加文字</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 4 }}>跨 run 保留原格式</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #E5E7EB', padding: '10px 12px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>段落排版</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 4 }}>对齐 / 行距 / 缩进</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #E5E7EB', padding: '10px 12px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>文字格式</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 4 }}>粗斜下划 / 颜色 / 字号</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #E5E7EB', padding: '10px 12px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>内容提取</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 4 }}>点名要字段，带出处</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 16, background: '#F0F5FC', padding: '14px 18px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>实测覆盖</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 2 }}>26 条指令 × 4 种格式</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 4 }}>docx / xlsx / md / txt 全覆盖矩阵 8/8 通过</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 14, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #E5E7EB', padding: '14px 16px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>一次真实解析（约 1 秒）</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568' }}>意图识别</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>format / 标题</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568' }}>执行动作</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>居中 + 加粗</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568' }}>原件是否改动</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E7A4B', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>否</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 12 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                模型只产出"意图"，真正的改动由格式操作库执行 —— 不会出现"理解对了但文件被改坏"。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, bottom: 72, width: 690, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #E5E7EB', padding: '12px 18px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>四格式全覆盖</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568' }}>docx ｜ xlsx ｜ md ｜ txt，26 条指令逐条实测</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, bottom: 20, width: 1200, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>A-23 基于大语言模型的文档理解与多源数据融合系统</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>11 / 22</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
